WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.300
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:24.000
You are my sun now

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.420
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.420
no matter who you are

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.840
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.560
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:50.980
is clear again

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.320
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.830
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.160
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.830
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:16.680
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.520
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.860
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:38.200
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.290
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:03.200
<i>Together with my companions, Barda and Jasmine, I defeated
several terrifying monsters and recovered six gems.</i>

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.760
<i>But to be honest, when I left the Forests of Silence to go on a journey with a stubborn old guy,</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.730
<i>Hey!</i>

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>along with this unreliable boy,</i>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>What was that?</i>

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.600
<i>I could only hope that
everything would be alright.</i>

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.170
<i>But by working together,
we've finally made it this far!</i>

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>There's only one gem remaining!</i>

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:24.830
<i>Our last perilous destination, The Valley of the Lost
where the diamond is hidden, is just right ahead!</i>

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.300
Endon?!

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:34.800
It's Endon?!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.500
Are you saying that the Guardian is King Endon?

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.200
It couldn't be! There's no way that
old man is actually King Endon!

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.800
If the door is opening for us,
then we must be right.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.000
This is the last gem...

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:05.000
Even if he <i>was</i> King Endon, now he
is just the Shadow Lord's servant,

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.300
the Guardian of the Valley of the Lost.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.900
Lief, take the gem.

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:11.100
Right.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.700
We've finally reached this point.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.400
Yes, it's the seventh gem.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.400
Lief, take the diamond.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.400
You three...

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:38.000
It seems that you guessed my name correctly.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.000
What is this place?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.200
I wonder where Lief and the others are.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.200
What are these things?!

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.600
Wait! Don't touch me!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:12.220
Until now, there was only one other man
to have correctly guessed my name.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:16.220
I believe his name... was Doom.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.900
He refused to take the diamond
after discovering my name.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:31.400
He had no desire to take something
tainted by evil, no matter the cause.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:36.030
He left this valley, cursing at me.

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:42.100
So that's why Doom tried to
prevent us from coming here.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:49.400
And what of yourselves? Will you also reject the
diamond now that you know my true name?

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:56.840
No. We won the game, so we
will take the diamond as agreed.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:03.250
I see, I see... You have made a
firm decision. In that case...

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.200
Pride!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:06.800
Lie!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.200
Envy!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.500
Greed!

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:14.100
What is happening?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.800
What are you trying to do?!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.820
I will allow you to have the diamond, however...

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.500
In return, you must leave the other gems behind.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.330
Each and every one that is set into that belt!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.800
Go!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.180
They must be over there.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.080
Shit! What's with these creatures?!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.200
They keep regenerating no matter
how many times we cut them!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.400
There is no way for you to defeat them.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:23.220
Only death awaits you!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.800
Neridah!

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:31.700
What?!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.400
What are you doing?!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.700
How beautiful!

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:49.900
I can spend the rest of my life enjoying myself with a diamond this big!

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.540
Neridah!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:51.960
Stop!

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.600
Sorry about this, Lief,
but I really need the money.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.050
What a treacherous woman!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:04.050
Are you fine with the diamond
being stolen from you?!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:11.600
There is no need to worry.
The diamond despises deceit.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:17.600
Any person greedy enough to steal it will
be punished in accordance with their sin.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:20.300
If you understand that, then why?!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.400
You will also be punished for deceit!

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:28.800
I do not lie! I possess the power
to protect my people!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:33.700
That is why the Shadow Lord
entrusted the diamond to me!

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:37.200
You're wrong! You are being punished already!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:43.090
That's right! The proof is that
you've been left all alone in this valley!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.500
Silence!

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.500
I'm not lonely!

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.220
Open your eyes! The Shadow Lord is just using you!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:54.700
I'm not being used! On the contrary,
it is I who is taking advantage of <i>him!</i>

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.790
That's right. You'd best stay still.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:16.200
Now, give the belt to me!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.080
Stop!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.400
I will find a good use for it!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.600
Stop it!!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.500
<i>Lapis lazuli.</i>

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.400
<i>A deep blue stone. Can be used to dispel evil spirits.</i>

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.100
What are you doing?!

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.100
Stop!!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.600
Help me!!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.100
They are going to eat me!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.370
Save me!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.000
Barda! Those veins!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:25.650
Those monsters were not his
pets, but part of his body.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:32.800
His wicked heart manifested into
monsters that grew and grew.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:35.300
Let's go.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.900
We have to take back the diamond.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.800
Damn that Neridah! Where did she run to?!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.000
Kree! Filli!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:51.300
This way!

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:12.500
Hello there.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.500
We meet again.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.500
Neridah!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:24.300
Help! Somebody help!

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.140
Help me!!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.000
Over here!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.640
Lief! You came to save me!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.100
Neridah!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.500
The seventh gem is right here.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:50.570
Now, will you not hand over the Belt of Deltora?

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.100
Orcus!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.200
It looks like there's no escaping this one.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.200
I won't forgive you for
burning the forest like this!

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:02.170
Hey, please! I gave you the diamond.
I have nothing to do with this anymore!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.100
You can give up the belt and burn to death,

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:10.000
or burn to death and have the belt
taken from your charred remains.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:12.380
Which do you prefer?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.770
I will not give up the belt!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.900
If you insist.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.950
Human strength can only do so much.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:41.500
So really, why are you even trying?

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.460
Are you not human too?

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:50.900
I have acquired great power. I will not
be compared to the likes of you.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.500
Why do you obey the Shadow Lord?!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.000
I need no reason.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.720
I just want to see beautiful things fall to ruin.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:06.950
That's wrong! Humans have the ability to create power
for themselves, and to unleash it if they choose!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:13.500
No matter how beautiful humans are,
in reality they are all foolish and unsightly.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:18.950
That moment when their true form is
revealed is my greatest pleasure!

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.600
Farewell, Lief.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.600
What?!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.700
What happened?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.000
The diamond hates deceit.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:20.550
If an evil person lays their hand on the diamond,
they are certain to encounter misfortune.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:23.200
So this is that misfortune, then.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.350
Geez, I thought I was going to die!

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:27.140
Neridah!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.150
Look at this beautiful diamond!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.400
Neridah.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.200
I want you to give back the diamond.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:39.200
It's hopeless, Lief. There's no
way Neridah would just return it!

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.600
So that's what everyone thinks of me...

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.600
Neridah...

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.000
Take it!

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.250
Thank you!

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.100
Let's run!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:00.970
Wait!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:03.800
In there!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.800
Wait, don't leave me behind!

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:17.800
It's a dead end!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:21.000
Isn't the diamond supposed
to dispel bad luck?!

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.620
Shit, at this rate...

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.600
It's over.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:46.350
If someone of righteous heart
lays his hand on the diamond,

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.950
he will be blessed with courage and strength, and be shielded from misfortune!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.520
What are you talking about?

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.400
Barda, Jasmine, dig a hole in the wall!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.350
Lief!

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.150
I will keep Orcus busy!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.900
When a hole opens, get out straight away!

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:02.990
Orcus. I challenge you!

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:10.000
It will be the same no matter
how many times you try.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.800
You cannot win against me.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.590
Lief, it's open!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.400
You have angered me, Lief...!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.100
What?!

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.700
What happened?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.230
Why did it explode?

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.600
I am a blacksmith's son, you know.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:44.600
What does that have to do with the explosion?

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:50.900
If you pump fresh air into a burning chamber,
the fire will become much bigger.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.000
It's the same principle as what happened here.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:16:01.500
So, because fresh air entered the tunnel while
it was on fire, it caused an explosion?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:02.600
That's right!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:08.760
Although, to cause an explosion capable of collapsing the entire tunnel...

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.100
It must be the diamond's luck.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.100
And thank you, Neridah.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:22.610
It's thanks to you returning the diamond.

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:25.400
I-I didn't really do much...

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:29.530
I just thought that I didn't need
such a terrifying gem anymore.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:37.000
I'll be going now. I don't want to get involved
in any nasty business by staying here.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.900
And I thought I'd take this too!

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.550
Hey, that's my money!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.300
See you later! Let's meet again somewhere!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.000
She's fast when on the run, at least.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.700
Oh well.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.820
We've finally done it, Lief.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.200
Yeah!

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.030
We finally got the seventh gem.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.780
Well done. Congratulations, Lief!

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.500
You two have done well to get this far.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.790
And these guys too.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.500
You're right.

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:23.200
Everyone, thank you so much.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:43.300
Hey, let's hurry and put
the diamond on the belt!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:43.940
Yeah!

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:49.200
<i>Lief has acquired the seventh gem, the diamond.</i>

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:53.500
<i>With this, all of the gems of
the belt have been gathered.</i>

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:56.450
With this, we have all of the gems for the belt.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.600
What happens now?

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.400
Nothing is happening.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:07.700
As I thought, it doesn't work
unless you have royal blood.

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:12.200
I suppose you're right. So our next objective
is to find the king's successor, then.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.970
The fog is swirling!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.200
It's coming from the Valley of the Lost.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.300
Let's take a look!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.500
The fog is clearing up.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:39.900
Are these the people who tried to find the
diamond and became trapped in the valley?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.920
That doesn't appear to be the case.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.400
I see! These people are...!

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:51.430
That's right. We are the Torans.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.800
Nice to meet you. I'm Lief of Del.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:59.950
I am the chief of the Toran tribe, Zeean.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:04.700
We'd like to ask you a question.
Why did the Torans betray King Endon?

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:10.200
Tora was protected by magic from its
inception, and was a prosperous city.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:15.700
Without this magical protection, and our dealings with the
other tribes, we could not have maintained this prosperity.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:23.900
But we lost sight of this, and began to think that our prosperity came from our own strength.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:28.800
We believed ourselves to be
absolutely just, and without flaw.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:34.450
Is that why you tore apart the letter
sent by King Endon asking for help?

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:39.020
Yes, not realising that in doing so,
we would break our oath.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:46.550
As a result, we were banished
to the valley as punishment.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:48.800
So, what about that Guardian?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.400
He wasn't King Endon!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:58.000
The old man, who had lived in the valley before even
the Torans were banished, can't be King Endon!

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.700
The palace is gone!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.810
Even after witnessing it with my
own eyes, I struggle to believe it.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.730
You are... the Guardian of the gem?

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.900
No, I'm no longer a Guardian.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.900
Thanks to you three.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.200
So you're not King Endon, are you?

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.370
That's right, I'm not King Endon.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.800
My name is Fardeep.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:55.470
I used to live a happy, wealthy and respected life.

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:59.100
Then why did you take the name of King Endon?

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:05.200
It was all the Shadow Lord's scheme to
have King Endon appear to be evil.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:12.550
So that's it! Doom completely fell for the
trick and came to despise King Endon!

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:16.600
Please, please forgive me!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:21.000
I have done such terrible things to you all.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.300
Fardeep...

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.400
Fardeep,

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.000
we are no less guilty than yourself.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:31.800
We lost our way and made a grave mistake.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:36.600
Please, allow us to live in
this valley from now on.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:41.400
We have no home to return to.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:45.400
Don't you have Tora to return to?

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:49.600
The city is just as it was in the past.

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:53.020
It's awaiting your return, even now.

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:59.200
No, we broke our oath.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:03.370
We can't go back into the city anymore.

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:06.300
No, you can still make amends.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:09.600
That's right, the curse is no more!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:15.300
That's true. The curse has indeed been lifted.

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:19.590
Will the day really come
when this will all be over?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:26.900
It's for that very reason that we must find the king's heir
to use the Belt of Deltora with all its seven gems.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:53.300
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.100
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.650
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:11.490
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:18.450
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.000
At this point

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:27.630
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:33.970
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:40.270
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:47.400
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:55.740
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.300
<i>The Guardian's Pets.</i>

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:16.700
<i>They are Pride, Lie, Envy, and Greed; four monsters
born from the wicked heart of the Guardian.</i>

00:24:16.700 --> 00:24:19.800
<i>They manifest as part of the Guardian's body.</i>

00:24:20.950 --> 00:24:23.720
We have gathered all the
gems of the Belt of Deltora.

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:27.000
But, the real task has just begun.

